rld champions for the past two years."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The final ended up being an all-China affair, as Zheng and Huang faced off against second-seeded " [:a {:href "/athletes/141824"} "Wang Yilyu"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/141648"} "Huang Dongping"] ", the most recent Asian champions. In a close and exciting match, Wang and Huang Dongping were able to defeat their compatriots and win an unexpected gold medal. Bronze, meanwhile, went to Japan’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/144559"} "Yuta Watanabe"] " and " [:a {:href "/athletes/144555"} "Arisa Higashino"] ", who were unseeded but had won a bronze medal at the most recent World Championships, after they defeated a duo from Hong Kong."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Pair"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/141824"} "Wang Yilyu"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/141648"} "Huang Dongping"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/CHN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/CHN.png"}] "CHN"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/141825"} "Zheng Siwei"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/141649"} "Huang Yaqiong"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/CHN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/CHN.png"}] "CHN"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/144559"} "Yuta Watanabe"] " / " [:a {:href "/athletes/144555"} "Arisa Higashino"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/JPN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/JPN.png"}] "JPN"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}]